WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:28.443
"Good-bye, Wizard," the knight said.

2
00:00:28.444 --> 00:00:33.819
Tom slammed the door shut after him.

3
00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:37.452
He did not want to help that bad knight.

4
00:00:37.453 --> 00:00:42.485
Cat was licking her paws.

5
00:00:42.486 --> 00:00:48.346
"What should I do, Cat?" Tom asked.

6
00:00:48.347 --> 00:00:54.297
"I'll talk to the horse," she said.

7
00:00:54.298 --> 00:01:03.618
That night Tom went to the jousting field.

8
00:01:03.619 --> 00:01:08.609
The knight rode in on his horse.

9
00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:12.087
"Whoa!" cried the knight.

10
00:01:12.088 --> 00:01:22.757
The horse threw him off her back!

11
00:01:22.758 --> 00:01:26.956
"This is a terrible horse!" the knight said.

12
00:01:26.957 --> 00:01:32.193
He looked furious.

13
00:01:32.194 --> 00:01:36.690
"She never obeys me."

14
00:01:36.691 --> 00:01:40.398
"Are you ready for the spell?" Tom asked.

15
00:01:40.399 --> 00:01:43.089
"Ha-ha!" The knight laughed.

16
00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:46.251
"Of course I'm ready, you fool.

17
00:01:46.252 --> 00:01:53.831
I want to win all the prize money!"

18
00:01:53.832 --> 00:01:58.842
Tom waved his wand. Poof!

19
00:01:58.843 --> 00:02:02.911
The field filled with smoke.

20
00:02:02.912 --> 00:02:13.178
Cat sneaked over to talk to the horse.

21
00:02:13.179 --> 00:02:16.952
A few minutes later the smoke cleared.

22
00:02:16.953 --> 00:02:20.895
"I did the spell," Tom said.

23
00:02:20.896 --> 00:02:27.565
"Good," the bad knight said.

24
00:02:27.566 --> 00:02:32.852
He got back on his horse.

25
00:02:32.853 --> 00:02:42.022
The knight rode up and down the field.

26
00:02:42.023 --> 00:02:51.110
This time the horse did not throw off the knight.

27
00:02:51.111 --> 00:02:54.306
This time the horse obeyed.

28
00:02:54.307 --> 00:02:59.304
"Your spell worked, Wizard!" the knight said.

29
00:02:59.305 --> 00:03:01.916
His grin was greedy.

30
00:03:01.917 --> 00:03:24.892
"The prize money is all mine!"
